   "sentenceId": 7,
   "he": "אַנְשֵׁי סְדוֹם אֵין לָהֶם חֵלֶק לָעוֹלָם הַבָּא וְכוּ' תָּנוּ רַבָּנַן אַנְשֵׁי סְדוֹם אֵין לָהֶן חֵלֶק לָעוֹלָם הַבָּא שֶׁנֶּאֱמַר 'וְאַנְשֵׁי סְדֹם רָעִים וְחַטָּאִים לַה' מְאֹד' 'רָעִים' בָּעוֹלָם הַזֶּה 'וְחַטָּאִים' לָעוֹלָם הַבָּא",
   "en": "§ The mishna teaches: «The people of Sodom have no share in the World-to-Come. The Sages taught: The people of Sodom have no share in the World-to-Come, as it is stated: “And the men of Sodom were wicked and sinners before the Lord exceedingly”» (Genesis 13:13). «“Wicked”» indicates «in this world; “and sinners”» indicates «for the World-to-Come.»"
  }
 ],
